# Gemma 4 via Google AI Studio (Gemini API)
#
# 1. Get your API key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local (that file is git-ignored — never commit it)
# 3. Paste your real key below (uncomment both lines)
#
# This key is read ONLY on the server, inside src/app/api/gemma/route.ts.
# It is never sent to the browser and never appears in the client JS bundle —
# do NOT rename these to NEXT_PUBLIC_*, that would leak the key publicly.
#
# Leave GEMINI_API_KEY unset to run KIBO fully on simulated responses
# (no key needed, the whole UI stays demoable offline).

# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemma-4-31b-it
# (real model IDs are versioned: gemma-4-31b-it or gemma-4-26b-a4b-it — "gemma-4" also works, it's aliased)
